ross projects and shared with the Max community.</p></div></div></section>\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t<section class=\"work-detail__section work-detail__section--credits\" data-work-detail-section=\"CREDITS\" aria-labelledby=\"work-detail-section-credits-257\"><h2 class=\"work-detail__label\" id=\"work-detail-section-credits-257\"><span class=\"work-detail__label-text\">CREDITS</span></h2><div class=\"work-detail__section-body\"><section class=\"work-detail__credits\" aria-labelledby=\"work-detail-credits-257\"><h2 id=\"work-detail-credits-257\" class=\"work-media__heading\">Credits</h2><dl id=\"work-credits-list-257\" class=\"work-credits\"><div class=\"work-credits__row\"><dt>Concept / Design / Development</dt><dd>PO HAO CHEN</dd></div>\n</dl></section></div></section>\n\t\t\t<section class=\"work-detail__section work-detail__section--gallery\" data-work-detail-section=\"GALLERY\" aria-labelledby=\"work-detail-section-gallery-257\"><h2 class=\"work-detail__label\" id=\"work-detail-section-gallery-257\"><span class=\"work-detail__label-text\">GALLERY</span></h2><div class=\"work-detail__section-body\"><div class=\"work-media work-media--gallery\"><section class=\"work-media__section work-media-gallery work-media-gallery--phc-recorder\" aria-labelledby=\"work-media-gallery-257\"><h2 id=\"work-media-gallery-257\" class=\"work-media__heading\">Gallery</h2><div class=\"work-media-gallery__grid\"><figure class=\"work-media-gallery__item\" style=\"--work-gallery-ratio: 1.3333\"><a class=\"work-media-gallery__link\" href=\"/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/attachment1-20260923.webp\" data-work-gallery-item data-work-gallery-index=\"0\" data-work-gallery-count=\"2\" aria-haspopup=\"dialog\" aria-label=\"Open image 1 of 2: PHC Recorder product overview with recording interface, features, and multichannel controls\"><img width=\"1024\" height=\"768\" src=\"/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/attachment1-20260923-1024x768.webp\" class=\"work-media-gallery__image\" alt=\"PHC Recorder product ov